### ====================================================================
### 阶段一错误场景测试
### 验证各类异常输入和边界条件的 HTTP 状态码与错误响应
### ====================================================================

### --- 400 参数错误 ---

### 400-1 登录缺少必填字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

> {%
  client.test("登录缺少字段返回 400", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 400, "预期状态码为 400");
    client.assert(response.body.success === false);
  });
%}

### 400-1.1 准备后续受保护错误场景的认证
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
  client.test("错误场景认证准备成功", function () { client.assert(response.status === 200); });
  client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
  client.global.set("runId", Date.now().toString());
%}

### 400-2 创建小区缺少必填字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/communities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "communityName": "只有名称没有编码"
}

> {%
  client.test("创建小区缺少编码返回 400", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 400, "预期状态码为 400");
    client.assert(response.body.success === false);
  });
%}

### 400-3 创建楼栋年份越界
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/buildings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "communityId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "buildingCode": "ERR-YEAR",
  "constructionYear": 1799
}

> {%
  client.test("年份过小返回 400", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 400, "预期状态码为 400");
    client.assert(response.body.success === false);
  });
%}

### 400-4 创建楼栋缺少必填字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/buildings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "buildingName": "缺少编码和小区ID"
}

> {%
  client.test("创建楼栋缺少必填字段返回 400", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 400, "预期状态码为 400");
    client.assert(response.body.success === false);
  });
%}

### --- 401 未认证 ---

### 401-1 无 Token 访问受保护接口
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me

> {%
  client.test("无 Token 返回 401", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 401, "预期状态码为 401");
  });
%}

### 401-2 无 Token 创建小区
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/communities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "communityCode": "ERR-UNAUTH",
  "communityName": "未认证创建"
}

> {%
  client.test("无 Token 创建小区返回 401", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 401, "预期状态码为 401");
  });
%}

### 401-3 无 Token 查询楼栋
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/buildings?page=0&size=10

> {%
  client.test("无 Token 查询楼栋返回 401", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 401, "预期状态码为 401");
  });
%}

### 401-4 无效 Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-here

> {%
  client.test("无效 Token 返回 401", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 401, "预期状态码为 401");
  });
%}

### --- 403 权限错误 ---
### 注意：403 场景通常需要特定角色的账号，此处使用占位

### 401-5 错误密码（验证身份验证失败）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "definitely_wrong"
}

> {%
  client.test("错误密码返回 401", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 401, "预期状态码为 401");
  });
%}

### --- 404 资源不存在 ---

### 404-1 查询不存在的小区
